'''Moldwarp''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]. One Moldwarp, [[Edmo Ectacle]], hailed from [[Lespectus]],<ref name="Datapad" /> and was present in the [[Canto Casino and Racetrack|casino]] in [[Canto Bight]] on the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]]<ref name="TLJVD" /> in around [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' places the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']] in [[34 ABY]]. As [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']] carries on immediately from the events of ''The Force Awakens'', it can be assumed to take place in the same [[Standard year|year]].</ref>

